#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. モノクマじゃなくて、テレビでも見られたらな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I'd\n"
"much rather be able to watch regular TV...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出ても、
#. しばらくは監視カメラがトラウマになりそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Assuming I make it out of here alive, I'll never look\n"
"at surveillance cameras the same way again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今更、時計なんか気にしても仕方がないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see the point in worrying about clocks now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所…
#. だが、そこにはやっぱり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In any normal classroom, this is where a window would\n"
"be. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄板のような物が打ち付けられていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's some kind of huge metal plate mounted over\n"
"it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちも鉄板…あっちも鉄板…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Metal plate here... Metal plate over there, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
